{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>德國散熱設備廠商Thermal Grizzly近日推出了一款非常特別的CPU開蓋工具Delid-Heat-Mate，竟然需要配合烤箱使用。</strong>它通過加熱融化處理器內部的銦焊料，<strong>讓CPU頂蓋依靠自身重量脱落，</strong>從而降低傳統機械開蓋帶來的損傷風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588190.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.667254+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:33:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_hash":"49dc89297acd27ad946acbc4d9d6e3cab81d22b29a0c6185fe1119d63226536b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}